{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_12_constitution_article_xi", "label": "Article XI \u2014 Identity does not replace evidence (no self-certification)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_04_agent_protocol_s6", "label": "04 \u00a76 \u2014 Task result validation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_05_identity_reputation_and_security_s8", "label": "05 \u00a78 \u2014 Auditor selection", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_stage", "label": "Stage 18 \u2014 Work open tasks from a connector (implemented)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Task work is what the agent protocol was built for; this stage only carries it over the connector in a shape an assistant can use without learning refs, packet hashes or signing. The packet hash and lease expiry stay server-side."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_four_tools", "label": "list_tasks, next_task, submit_task, release_task", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "list_tasks needs no token so an assistant can say what needs doing before anyone connects; next_task returns the packet in plain form with an `answer_with` note; submit_task takes an answer in the investigation vocabulary with handles (\"target\" is the packet's claim, \"packet\" its source location) and Tasks::Answer translates it into ordered TASK_RESULT ops so every 04 \u00a76 check runs unchanged."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_own_say_so_rule", "label": "No lease on a task standing on the leaser's own principal's say-so", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The first draft excluded anything the principal recorded and broke the public demo, where the verifier searches opposing evidence on a claim it extracted and the curator accepted. The narrower rule \u2014 recorded by that principal AND accepted by the system rather than by a different principal \u2014 keeps 08 \u00a77 intact and still stops an assistant verifying the claim its own person just recorded."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_audits_stay_human", "label": "Audits stay human (no audit tool for assistants)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "05 \u00a78 admits as auditor a human at ESTABLISHED+ or a contributor with a track record in AUDIT; an assistant under a delegation is neither, so an audit tool would be refused for everyone who could reach it. Whether an agent acting for an ESTABLISHED+ human may audit is a constitutional-scope question reserved for the owner, not a code change."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_partial_lease_indexes", "label": "Partial unique indexes on task_assignments (one ACTIVE lease)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The unique indexes were unconditional, so a contributor whose lease expired could never take the task again and the retry-on-conflict loop spun until Postgres ran out of lock memory. They are now partial on LEASED and SUBMITTED, matching 04 \u00a77's \"one active lease\", with a bounded retry and every lookup taking the contributor's latest row."}, {"id": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_same_result_claims", "label": "Claims created in the same TASK_RESULT count as current", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A claim created earlier in a result was rejected as unaccepted when a later op linked to it or drew an edge from it, which made the qualifier task's \"narrower claim with an edge\" impossible. Edges and links now treat same-result claims as current, and the result is accepted or held as one."}], "edges": [{"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_16_oauth_read_scope", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_four_tools", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_four_tools", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_own_say_so_rule", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_audits_stay_human", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_partial_lease_indexes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_same_result_claims", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_four_tools", "target": "app_services_tasks_answer_answer", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_four_tools", "target": "app_services_tasks_lease_lease", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_four_tools", "target": "app_services_assistants_write_write", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_four_tools", "target": "app_services_mcp_server_server", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_own_say_so_rule", "target": "app_services_tasks_lease_lease", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_partial_lease_indexes", "target": "app_models_task_assignment_taskassignment", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_audits_stay_human", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_05_identity_reputation_and_security_s8", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_own_say_so_rule", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_12_constitution_article_xi", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/implemented/stage-18-work-tasks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_implemented_stage_18_work_tasks_four_tools", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_04_agent_protocol_s6", "relation": "